#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:49
msgid ""
"This example reproduces the learning-curve experiment in Figure 1(a) of "
"Zhang et al. Five Small Inception models are trained on true labels, "
"fixed random labels, globally shuffled pixels, independently shuffled "
"pixels, and Gaussian inputs. Every condition reaches 100% training "
"accuracy and a final interval loss below 0.0014. The overall convergence "
"order matches the paper. The random-pixel and random-label curves fall "
"later than their visual positions in the original figure."
msgstr ""
"本示例复现 Zhang 等人 Figure 1(a) 的学习曲线实验。五个 Small Inception "
"模型分别使用真实标签、固定随机标签、全局打乱的像素、逐图独立打乱的像素和高斯输入进行训练。所有条件均达到 100% 训练准确率，最终区间损失低于 "
"0.0014。整体收敛顺序与论文一致，但随机像素和随机标签曲线下降的时间晚于原图的视觉位置。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:58
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [Understanding Deep Learning Requires Rethinking "
"Generalization](https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.03530)"
msgstr "**论文：** [理解深度学习需要重新思考泛化](https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.03530)"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:61
msgid "**Template:** `repro: Zhang et al. Figure 1(a) random-label memorization`"
msgstr "**模板：** `repro: Zhang et al. Figure 1(a) random-label memorization`"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:63
msgid "**Template ID:** `repro-random-label-memorization-fig1a`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `repro-random-label-memorization-fig1a`"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:65
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:67
msgid ""
"The experiment asks whether conventional neural networks fit only "
"meaningful input-label relationships or whether they can also memorize "
"arbitrary assignments. Figure 1(a) compares training loss under five "
"fixed data conditions:"
msgstr "该实验考察传统神经网络是只能拟合有意义的输入—标签关系，还是也能记住任意映射。Figure 1(a) 比较五种固定数据条件下的训练损失："

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:72
msgid "**true labels:** unchanged CIFAR-10 images and labels;"
msgstr "**真实标签：** CIFAR-10 图像和标签保持不变；"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:73
msgid ""
"**random labels:** every training label is replaced by a fixed uniform "
"random class;"
msgstr "**随机标签：** 每个训练标签均替换为固定的、均匀采样的随机类别；"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:75
msgid "**shuffled pixels:** one fixed pixel permutation is shared by all images;"
msgstr "**打乱像素：** 所有图像共享同一个固定的像素置换；"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:76
msgid ""
"**random pixels:** every image receives its own fixed pixel permutation; "
"and"
msgstr "**随机像素：** 每张图像各自使用一个固定的像素置换；以及"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:77
msgid ""
"**gaussian:** image values are replaced by fixed Gaussian inputs with "
"matched statistics."
msgstr "**高斯输入：** 图像像素值替换为统计量匹配的固定高斯输入。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:80
msgid ""
"The target phenomenon is complete training-set fitting in all five "
"conditions, with the true-label curve dropping first and the random-label"
" curve last."
msgstr "目标现象是五种条件下都能完全拟合训练集，其中真实标签曲线最先下降，随机标签曲线最后下降。"

