#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:139
msgid ""
"The threshold times preserve the paper's overall ordering: meaningful "
"labels are fitted first, shared input structure helps, and arbitrary "
"labels require the longest high-loss phase. Random pixels and random "
"labels converge later than in a visual reading of the original Figure "
"1(a). The comparison metrics are ordering and threshold times."
msgstr ""
"达到阈值的时间保留了论文中的整体顺序：有意义的标签最先被拟合，共享的输入结构有助于训练，而任意标签需要经历最长的高损失阶段。随机像素和随机标签的收敛时间晚于从原始 "
"Figure 1(a) 图中直观看到的位置。比较指标是顺序和达到阈值的时间。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:145
msgid "Interpretation"
msgstr "解释"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:147
msgid ""
"Training accuracy alone does not distinguish meaningful input-label "
"structure from memorization. The same architecture and optimizer drive "
"training error to zero even when labels contain no information about the "
"inputs."
msgstr "仅凭训练准确率无法区分有意义的输入—标签结构和记忆。即使标签不含任何输入信息，相同的架构和优化器仍会将训练误差降至零。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:151
msgid ""
"The true-label model reached 86.71% test accuracy. The random-label model"
" reached 10.31%, close to chance on CIFAR-10. These supplementary values "
"are outside Figure 1(a)'s learning-curve comparison."
msgstr ""
"真实标签模型的测试准确率达到 86.71%，随机标签模型为 10.31%，接近 CIFAR-10 的随机猜测水平。这些补充数值不属于 Figure "
"1(a) 的学习曲线比较。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:155
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:157
msgid ""
"One deterministic seed is used per condition, so seed-to-seed uncertainty"
" is unmeasured."
msgstr "每种条件仅使用一个确定的 seed，因此未衡量不同 seed 之间的不确定性。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:159
msgid ""
"Unreported implementation choices can explain part of the horizontal "
"difference from the original curves."
msgstr "未报告的实现选择可能解释其与原始曲线之间的部分横向差异。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:161
msgid ""
"Coverage is limited to Figure 1(a) and the Small Inception CIFAR-10 "
"setting."
msgstr "实验仅覆盖 Figure 1(a) 和 Small Inception 的 CIFAR-10 设置。"

#: ../../docs/en/examples/reproductions/random-label-memorization-figure1a.md:162
msgid ""
"The experiment measures memorization capacity. The generalization "
"mechanism of stochastic gradient methods remains outside the scope."
msgstr "本实验测量的是记忆能力；随机梯度方法的泛化机制不在讨论范围内。"
